{{also|Experiment}}
==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*per-|id=risk}}
From {{inh|en|enm|experiment}}, from {{der|en|fro|esperiment}} ({{cog|fr|expérience}}), from {{der|en|la|experimentum||experience, attempt, experiment}}, from {{m|la|experior||to experience, to attempt}}, itself from {{m|la|ex}} + {{m|la|*perior}}, in turn from {{der|en|ine-pro|*per-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ɪkˈspɛɹ.ɪ.mənt/|/ɛkˈspɛɹ.ɪ.mənt/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ɪkˈspɛɹ.ə.mənt/|/ɪkˈspɪɹ.ə.mənt/}}
** {{audio|en|en-us-experiment.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{hyphenation|en|ex|per|i|ment}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[test]] under [[controlled]] [[condition]]s made to either [[demonstrate]] a [[known]] [[truth]], [[examine]] the [[validity]] of a [[hypothesis]], or [[determine]] the [[efficacy]] or [[likelihood]] of something [[previously]] [[untried]].
#: {{coi|en|conduct an '''experiment'''}}
#: {{coi|en|carry out some '''experiments'''}}
#: {{coi|en|perform a scientific '''experiment'''}}
#* {{RQ:Landon Ethel Churchill|page=327|volume=II|passage=From her childhood she had been accustomed to watch, and often to aid, in her uncle's chemical '''experiments'''; she was, therefore, not at a loss, as a complete novice in the science would have been.}}
#* '''2019''', [https://web.archive.org/web/20190311070055/https://learningenglish.voanews.com/a/south-korea-proposes-rain-project-with-china-to-cut-pollution/4819207.html VOA Learning English] (public domain)
#*: South Korean officials announced last month that an '''experiment''' to create artificial rain did not provide the desired results.
#*:: {{audio|en|South Korean officials announced last month that an experiment to create artificial rain did not provide the desired results.ogg|Audio (US)}}
# {{lb|en|obsolete}} [[experience|Experience]], practical familiarity with something.
#* {{RQ:Spenser Faerie Queene|II|vi|passage=Pilot [...] Vpon his card and compas firmes his eye, <br> The maisters of his long '''experiment''', <br> And to them does the steddy helme apply [...].}}

